+
+Covers:
+- SC-4: Zero production HTTP calls during tests
+- Gate 2a: External API isolation (ZERO TOLERANCE — BUSINESS CRITICAL)
+- Seed test criteria #5: zero outbound HTTP to api.target.com
+
+Uses `respx` to assert zero outbound calls to api.target.com.
+"""
+
+import pytest
